  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 701.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 701.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to protect public health and the environment by establishing minimum technical standards and requirements for the planning, design, and construction of sewerage and wastewater treatment facilities, including solids handling and disposal facilities.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 700) #8590, eff 3-25-06; ss by #10693, eff 10-15-14; ss by #14258, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
